      "en": "for his judgments are true and righteous. For he has judged the great prostitute who corrupted the earth with her sexual immorality, and he has avenged the blood of his servants at her hand.”",
      "ko": "그의 심판은 참되고 의로운지라 음행으로 땅을 더럽게 한 큰 음녀를 심판하사 자기 종들의 피를 그의 손에 갚으셨도다 하고",
      "source_text_hash": "565a6bad1676506fa1f3c5691868bcd25f8c98c65ea5b02c9bb549b615e44bfd",
      "translation_text_hash": "7c35cff13b778e68d03feb8ed253492c6f30bde9d3b3b19ec41673593ace9d87",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
