      "en": "The twenty-four elders and the four living creatures fell down and worshiped God who sits on the throne, saying, “Amen! Hallelujah!”",
      "ko": "또 이십 사 장로와 네 생물이 엎드려 보좌에 앉으신 하나님께 경배하여 가로되 아멘 할렐루야 하니",
      "source_text_hash": "dfa4ac045bb61cfafb5f9ff0918a0789c5042566288f3fd75ca2af980d7e63c7",
      "translation_text_hash": "9357a5d8a320dc4858c6f914016ef7f833cf6a8fdc3f10b3ea18e1036e4b0abd",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
