      "en": "It was given to her that she would array herself in bright, pure, fine linen, for the fine linen is the righteous acts of the saints.",
      "ko": "그에게 허락하사 빛나고 깨끗한 세마포를 입게 하셨은즉 이 세마포는 성도들의 옳은 행실이로다 하더라",
      "source_text_hash": "ee8436dd82b21ab572a5c5760c267bc5e5d9d6313d2e9ee1f67f612978a08843",
      "translation_text_hash": "0357247f602b151482b1d60f8ddc6f0fe2c889e59ca1e7d0b12a472dbd13b0db",
