      "en": "The beast was taken, and with him the false prophet who worked the signs in his sight, with which he deceived those who had received the mark of the beast and those who worshiped his image. These two were thrown alive into the lake of fire that burns with sulfur.",
      "ko": "짐승이 잡히고 그 앞에서 이적을 행하던 거짓 선지자도 함께 잡혔으니 이는 짐승의 표를 받고 그의 우상에게 경배하던 자들을 이적으로 미혹하던 자라 이 둘이 산채로 유황불 붙는 못에 던지우고",
      "source_text_hash": "010eb97a5ed63f0323b0a93ca47e12ffbbc5372a88a615d3a93ccf5493f54363",
      "translation_text_hash": "ff7e8aae70847e47e84bb17337d414f19639622666dc387ede607a38653f88d3",
